     "<div><div style=\"width:576px\"><p>Dave gave a great intro to MCMC in R today.  His presentation and code can be found at <a href=\"http://www.google.com/url?q=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdavharris%2Fmcmc-tutorial&amp;sa=D&amp;sntz=1&amp;usg=AFQjCNHPgc-KFHoyJ4KOp897ifynbPYoZQ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.google.com/url?q%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fgithub.com%252Fdavharris%252Fmcmc-tutorial%26sa%3DD%26sntz%3D1%26usg%3DAFQjCNHPgc-KFHoyJ4KOp897ifynbPYoZQ&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792469663008000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3ZBNjiPpFi9IIW1r8SR6kn\">https://github.com/davharris/mcmc-tutorial</a>.<p>Today was the quarter&#39;s last work session so it&#39;s time to select a meeting time!  Please select your available times below.</p></p>\r\nIf you have trouble viewing or submitting this form, you can fill it out online:\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1zQu6ijc5aYXtgpZBc2jRDyLVT4Pjkp7DSckAtggjVNI/viewform?sid=278116c804f01ea6&amp;token=dyUlZj0BAAA.24121SzBcWxiNlNUHPA8ug.DJx5sQ2ifE-UlDkXY2WkOQ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1zQu6ijc5aYXtgpZBc2jRDyLVT4Pjkp7DSckAtggjVNI/viewform?sid%3D278116c804f01ea6%26token%3DdyUlZj0BAAA.24121SzBcWxiNlNUHPA8ug.DJx5sQ2ifE-UlDkXY2WkOQ&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792469663008000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2yMaZbUJCRhXP2ErofDZCe\">https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1zQu6ijc5aYXtgpZBc2jRDyLVT4Pjkp7DSckAtggjVNI/viewform?sid=278116c804f01ea6&amp;token=dyUlZj0BAAA.24121SzBcWxiNlNUHPA8ug.DJx5sQ2ifE-UlDkXY2WkOQ</a>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><h1 dir=\"ltr\">We are selecting a meeting time for Spring 2013.  What works for you?</h1>\r\n<p></p></div>\r\n<div style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;display:inline\">\r\n</div>\r\n<div><div><form action=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1zQu6ijc5aYXtgpZBc2jRDyLVT4Pjkp7DSckAtggjVNI/formResponse\" method=\"POST\" target=\"_blank\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin:12px 0\"><div style=\"max-width:100%\"><label><div style=\"display:block;font-weight:bold\">\r\n</div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display:block;margin:.1em 0 .25em 0;color:#666\"></div></label>\r\n<ul style=\"list-style:none;margin:.5em 0 0 0;padding:0\"><li style=\"margin:0;line-height:1.3em;padding-bottom:.5em\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"entry.273376035\" value=\"Mondays 3-5\">\r\n<span>Mondays 3-5</span></label></li> <li style=\"margin:0;line-height:1.3em;padding-bottom:.5em\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"entry.273376035\" value=\"Tuesdays 3-5\">\r\n<span>Tuesdays 3-5</span></label></li> <li style=\"margin:0;line-height:1.3em;padding-bottom:.5em\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"entry.273376035\" value=\"Wednesdays 3-5\">\r\n<span>Wednesdays 3-5</span></label></li> <li style=\"margin:0;line-height:1.3em;padding-bottom:.5em\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"entry.273376035\" value=\"Thursdays 1-3\">\r\n<span>Thursdays 1-3</span></label></li> <li style=\"margin:0;line-height:1.3em;padding-bottom:.5em\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"entry.273376035\" value=\"Fridays 10-12\">\r\n<span>Fridays 10-12</span></label></li> <li style=\"margin:0;line-height:1.3em;padding-bottom:.5em\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"entry.273376035\" value=\"__other_option__\">\r\nOther:</label>\r\n<input type=\"text\" name=\"entry.273376035.other_option_response\" value=\"\" dir=\"auto\"></li></ul></div></div></div> <div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin:12px 0\"><div style=\"max-width:100%\"><label><div style=\"display:block;font-weight:bold\">Any topics you want to cover in Spring 2013?\r\n</div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display:block;margin:.1em 0 .25em 0;color:#666\"></div></label>\r\n<textarea name=\"entry.1203294909\" rows=\"8\" cols=\"0\" dir=\"auto\" style=\"width:70%\"></textarea>\r\n</div></div></div>\r\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"draftResponse\" value=\"[]\r\n\">\r\n<input type=\"